WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/driving/components/driving-dynamics/DrivingCoachSection.tsx — a presentational section
  receiving a single `coachData: DrivingCoachData | undefined` from its parent (`useTranslation` only; no
  hooks, no unit conversion — the coach summary already arrives in Wh/km + km). Seven regions:
    1. Driving Score gauge   (RadialGauge)  — overall_score 0–100, threshold color (green ≥75 / amber ≥50 /
                                              red), "{{count}} drives analyzed" caption.
    2. Style Breakdown       (bar + legend) — efficient / moderate / aggressive shares of total_drives_analyzed;
                                              inner empty "Drive more to see your style breakdown." when total==0.
    3. Efficiency stats      (StatCard ×2)  — avg + best efficiency_wh_km.
    4. Weekly Score Trend    (LineChart)    — score over weekly_trend weeks (y 0–100); inner empty
                                              "Need at least 2 weeks of data…" until weekly_trend.length > 1.
    5. Driving Patterns      (bars ×5)      — hard accel/brake, highway, short trips, cold starts; each tinted
                                              by the web lo/hi thresholds (20/40, 15/30, 50/70, 30/50, 15/30).
    6. Recommendations       (cards)        — impact Badge (high→danger / medium→warning / low→success) + tip;
                                              inner empty "Recommendations will appear after more drives."
    7. Per-Drive Scores      (DataTable)    — Date / Score / Style / Wh/km / Distance, sortable + paginated;
                                              inner empty "Drive data will appear after your first trip."

